  "journal": {
    "firstbrook_morning": {
      "title": "A New Morning",
      "text": "Elara woke me again. Orin will say I slept until noon; I didn't. The eastern bridge is mended and Bram carried the wood. In the square I felt the ground shiver, just for a moment, and Elara looked toward the northern hills. Probably nothing. Elder Rowan was looking for me."
